  "prefLabel": "Ph 906.01 Renewal Registrations Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 906.01 Renewal Registrations Required. All mail-order pharmacy registrations shall expire on December 31 biennially in each odd-numbered year for odd-numbered licenses or on December 31 of each even-numbered year for even-numbered licenses.\n\nSource. #7474, eff 4-5-01; ss by #9341, eff 12-4-08; ss by #10663, eff 9-3-14; ss by #13244, eff 7-30-21",
